<section class="visually-hidden">
  <h2>About Shrinath Prabhu</h2>
  <p>
    Shrinath Prabhu is a Senior Staff Frontend Engineer based in Mumbai,
    India, with over 7 years of professional experience. He currently works
    at Avail Project (availproject.org), where he leads frontend
    architecture across the Nexus product ecosystem.
  </p>
  <p>
    Previously, Shrinath led frontend engineering at Arcana Network for 4.5
    years, from seed stage through the company's acquisition by Avail
    Project in 2025. He has shipped 4 Chrome Extensions to the Chrome Web
    Store with a 100% approval rate, including a non-custodial multi-chain
    wallet supporting 13 blockchains (4.7 star rating, 750+ users).
  </p>
  <p>
    His highest-traction product, SendIt, scaled to over 65,000 registered
    accounts and over 20,000 peak daily active users. The frontend traffic
    was significant enough to exhaust Netlify Pro plan limits, requiring
    migration to self-managed AWS infrastructure.
  </p>
  <p>
    Core technology stack: Vue 3, Nuxt 3, React, TypeScript, Node.js, Chrome
    Extension Architecture (Manifest V3), Web3 & DeFi integrations, Vite,
    Bun, Elysia.js, Express.js, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, AWS, Docker.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before Arcana, he worked at Hashbinary Services as a Full Stack
    Developer, building Pricinger (privacy Chrome Extension, ~1,000 users),
    and was a dedicated resource for Agrostar where he delivered a farmer
    learning platform MVP within a week.
  </p>
  <p>
    Shrinath is also building Outline Analytics, a privacy-first,
    cookie-free web analytics platform (useoutline.xyz). He uses
    AI-augmented development workflows including Claude Code, OpenAI Codex,
    and Google Gemini.
  </p>
